            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner George Sheetz was required to pay a $23,420 traffic\u2011impact fee to obtain a residential building permit from the County of El Dorado."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2b261065d40e4cb99c40a8b5f0fdee452ea6258f9ac94414fa81aa58e85992ea",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2b261065d40e-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to the Court, Sheetz argued that conditioning the permit on the fee constituted an unlawful exaction violating the Takings Clause."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2b261065d40e4cb99c40a8b5f0fdee452ea6258f9ac94414fa81aa58e85992ea",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2b261065d40e-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Lower courts rejected Sheetz, holding that Nollan and Dolan apply only to ad\u2011hoc administrative conditions, not to a fee enacted by the legislature."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b637fba0d78d34f2b7a82c16a4e8a4de0eafbc8acaa217f745efb853c25c5fe5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b637fba0d78d-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "b637fba0d78d34f2b7a82c16a4e8a4de0eafbc8acaa217f745efb853c25c5fe5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b637fba0d78d-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 52,
              "start": 52
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, the Court needed to decide whether Nollan/Dolan scrutiny applies to legislative exactions such as the County\u2019s fee."
      }
    ],
