            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 14,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the Takings Clause applies equally to legislatures and agencies, prohibiting unconstitutional conditions on land\u2011use permits."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2b261065d40e4cb99c40a8b5f0fdee452ea6258f9ac94414fa81aa58e85992ea",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2b261065d40e-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch concurred, stating that a compensable taking exists if the condition is imposed outside the permitting context."
      }
    ],
